sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant SimulationController
    participant SimulationOrchestrator
    participant JobScheduler
    participant JobRunner
    participant EventBus
    participant Cache
    participant CalculationClient
    participant SaSSideCar
    participant CalculationEngine
    participant SaSRepository
    participant SaSDB

    User->>SimulationController: POST /simulation (REST/JSON)
    SimulationController->>SimulationOrchestrator: Start simulation
    SimulationOrchestrator->>Cache: Check cache (Redis)
    Cache-->>SimulationOrchestrator: Cache result
    SimulationOrchestrator->>JobScheduler: Schedule job (Internal API/Cron)
    JobScheduler->>JobRunner: Queue job (Queue/Internal API)

    JobRunner->>EventBus: Publish job started event
    JobRunner->>CalculationClient: Send compute request (gRPC/HTTP)
    CalculationClient->>CalculationEngine: Execute calculation (gRPC/HTTP)
    CalculationEngine-->>CalculationClient: Return results
    CalculationClient-->>JobRunner: Computation complete

    JobRunner->>SaSSideCar: Persist scenario (gRPC/HTTP)
    SaSSideCar->>SaSRepository: Save data (gRPC/HTTP)
    SaSRepository->>SaSDB: Store in database (JDBC/SQL)
